to tra gli uomini nasce qualcuno con poteri psichici, un Mu, razza che la Dominazione Superiore tenta di annientare. La storia inizia quando Jomi Marks Shin viene scoperto in possesso di enormi poteri psichici ed è salvato da Soldier Blue, il leader di un gruppo di Mu che sta cercando di ritornare sulla Terra, ormai troppo debole per poter continuare a condurre i suoi uomini, che lascerà il comando a Jomi."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Toward the Terra","overview":"A young boy learns he is part of a powerful race of psionic humans who must fight the normal humans determined to keep them from Earth."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"地球へ…","overview":"舞台は、今よりも遥か遠い未来。人類は環境破壊により滅び行く地球を再生させるため、植民惑星へ移住した。\r コンピュータ管理により整然と生きる人類。その一方で疎まれる、特殊な能力を持つ「ミュウ」という存在。\r 彼らは過酷な弾圧の中で政府の目から逃がれ、息を潜めながらも自分たちの存在意義を考え、そして地球への帰還を夢みていた―。\r ミュウのリーダー、ソルジャー・ブルーは、アタラクシアに住む少年ジョミーを自分の後継者として選び、夢を託す。  故郷・地球へ還る―――　\r その強い想いから、彼らの地球を目指す戦いが始まる。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y1tOtimB7VsXFGHoThRNvRbX8up.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y1tOtimB7VsXFGHoThRNvRbX8up.png","language":"ja","width":1600,"height":516},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lFHU1Ly8WLzGR8hE53pKyhATn8W.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lFHU1Ly8WLzGR8hE53pKyhATn8W.png","language":"ja","width":1600,"height":516},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xs0JbpChPtJoXa4DXqEaI3NiZf1.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xs0JbpChPtJoXa4DXqEaI3NiZf1.png","language":"ja","width":1600,"height":526}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/owNyTrZDbQS797bcXeLZovKPcCQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/owNyTrZDbQS797bcXeLZovKPcCQ.jpg","language":"ja","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mXnFbcoXDFGtxQWOz79n2V6kyqY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mXnFbcoXDFGtxQWOz79n2V6kyqY.jpg","language":"ja","wid